<title>FINLAND: IISI World steel consumption forecasts to 2000.</title>
<headline>IISI World steel consumption forecasts to 2000.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Iron and Steel Institute on Monday issued the following forecasts for world apparent steel consumption (million tonnes of steel products):</p>
<p> Region	  1995	1996     1997   pct change pct change</p>
<p>							 96/95	 97/96</p>
<p> EU		125.6     116.7    122.4    -7.1	  +4.9</p>
<p> Other W.Euro   14.5	15.0     16.0    +3.5	  +6.7</p>
<p> Total W.Euro  140.1     131.7    138.4    -6.0	  +5.1</p>
<p> E.Europe	 17.3	17.8     18.3    +2.9	  +2.5</p>
<p> Ex-USSR	  35.7	34.6     34.5    -3.1	  -0.3</p>
<p> Canada	   12.8	12.2     12.4    -4.7	  +1.6</p>
