<p> Mexico	    6.2	 7.2	8.5   +16.1	 +18.1</p>
<p> Brazil	   12.0	12.5     13.3    +4.2	  +6.4</p>
<p> Other Lat Am    7.5	 7.4	7.4    +1.3	    0</p>
