<p> Total Asia    288.5     298.9    312.0    +3.6	  +4.4</p>
<p> Aus., N.Z.	6.5	 6.7	7.0    +3.8	  +4.8</p>
<p> Africa	   14.1	13.9     13.7    -1.6	  -0.9</p>
<p> Middle East     9.0	10.1     10.5   +12.0	  +4.3</p>
